CLAUDE.local.md
.env
node_modules/
# Bundled peer-host Node under `.runtime` must keep its own node_modules
# (corepack/npm); the desktop shell invokes those shims on every launch.
!.runtime/**/node_modules/
lib/
# Source trees may contain a directory named `lib` (e.g. `src/client/lib`); re-include those.
!**/src/**/lib/
